    <value>This connector allows you to load data from Trimble Connect models. IFC embedded propertysets are loaded by default, optional are type, product, boundingBox, hierarchyInfo and layerIds. Any properties that are added ini Trimble are fetched if present. You are also able to filter your results through the ODATA filter of the Model API.</value>
